{"unit_id":"uknowmyface__locallens#card-zh","repo":"uknowmyface/locallens","commit":"22099c5ccee08c002e8c55e771e9e87632ba5222","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"LocalLens 是面向 DSH 的 macOS 本地 OCR 工具插件，可把屏幕截图、剪贴板图片或图片文件中的文字提取出来。它通过 DSH 工具接口注册 screenshot_ocr，由 Apple Vision 框架识别文字，并将结果以文本行返回。用户可以选择 screen、clipboard 或 file 作为输入来源，也可指定识别语言；整屏截取失败时会给出权限提示，结果为空时会提示检查截图或权限。适合需要让 DSH 读取报错截图、剪贴板内容或图片文字的场景。运行需要 macOS、Node.js 22 及首次调用时可用的 Swift 编译器；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:33-97","lib/ocr-engine.js:85-133","assets/ocr.swift:95-123"]}
{"unit_id":"uknowmyface__locallens#card-en","repo":"uknowmyface/locallens","commit":"22099c5ccee08c002e8c55e771e9e87632ba5222","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"LocalLens is a macOS OCR tool for DSH. Its screenshot_ocr tool uses Apple Vision to extract text from screen captures, clipboard images, and image files. It requires macOS, Node.js 22, and Swift on first use; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:33-97","lib/ocr-engine.js:85-133","assets/ocr.swift:95-123"]}
